{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117642","id":3421174498,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7L6vri","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117642","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117642.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117642.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117642","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117642/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117642/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117642/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/88a51aed0036adc724f710842fb7275564fd3dd2","number":117642,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Highlight help items when following documentation references","user":{"login":"masoud-ata","id":54315689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzE1Njg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54315689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata","html_url":"https://github.com/masoud-ata","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\n## Summary\r\nHighlights the relevant help item when following documentation references to methods/properties/etc.\r\n\r\n## Motivation\r\nCloses godotengine/godot-proposals#2248.\r\n\r\nWhen navigating cross-references inside the documentation, especially in classes with many members or long pages, it can be hard to visually locate the referenced method/property after the jump. Highlighting the destination makes navigation clearer and faster.\r\n\r\n## Example screenshot\r\n<img width=\"2739\" height=\"1567\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4ac40983-05e3-4f6a-8e04-2d81620d7a52\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n## Technical details\r\n- Added highlighting for the destination help item when a documentation reference is followed.\r\n- Updated the relevant documentation/help UI code to make the referenced section easier to identify after navigation.\r\n- The change is minimal and kept local to the editor_help code.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n- Built the editor locally.\r\n- Opened the class reference/help viewer.\r\n- Clicked method/property references in a script file or directly from the documentation pages.\r\n- Verified that the referenced help item is visibly highlighted after navigation.\r\n- Confirmed normal navigation still works as expected and the highlighted item remains visible after switching to other windows or scrolling.\r\n\r\n## Related proposal\r\n- godotengine/godot-proposals#2248","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.git